{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 46, :comments ["<b>I am disgusted with my life</b> — small qof, for she saw that the Temple was destined to be destroyed, whose height was 100 cubits; and the qof of ודרור (Leviticus 25:10) is large, corresponding to what David sought for the Sanctuary, whose height was 100 cubits, that it not be destroyed."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:13.467390815Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}